menu "KVMpad network status (TASK-080)"

    config KVM_NET_CONSOLE_JOIN
        bool "Bench only: `wifi join` console command (HIL provisioning before the Settings screen exists)"
        default n
        help
            Adds `wifi join <ssid> <password>` to the UART console so a bench unit can be put on a test network
            before the local Settings screen (TASK-070C) exists. The console echoes what is typed, so the command
            must be sent only by test/hil/wifi_provision.py, which never writes the exchange to a log. Never
            enable it in a release build (ADR-015).

endmenu
